---
title: Happy Path - Image to Cluster
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    %% =======================================================================
    %% HAPPY PATH: IMAGE INPUT -> CLUSTERED GROUP
    %% Summary diagram to avoid duplication.
    %% See recognize_faces.mmd + unified-assignment.mmd for detailed steps.
    %% =======================================================================

    participant Client as HTTP Client
    participant API as /recognition/analyze
    participant Queue as ScanQueueService
    participant Worker as scan_worker.py
    participant ScanSvc as ScanService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant ClusterAPI as /recognition/clustering/jobs
    participant ClusterSvc as ClusterService
    participant Discovery as Discovery Pipeline
    participant Gate as AssignmentGate
    participant Writer as AssignmentWriter

    Note over Client,Writer: Legend: ENTRY = external entrypoint, Dashed arrow = optional wiring
    Note over Client,Writer: Summary only. Details: workflows/recognize_faces.mmd + workflows/unified-assignment.mmd

    %% Phase 1: Analyze images
    Client->>API: ENTRY: POST /recognition/analyze {media_items}
    API->>Queue: create_scan_job_record()
    Queue->>DB: INSERT identity_scan_jobs + scan_job_items
    API-->>Client: 202 {job_id}

    Worker->>DB: claim scan_job_items
    Worker->>ScanSvc: process_media_item()
    ScanSvc->>DB: INSERT media_identities
    Worker->>Queue: refresh_job_progress(job_id)

    %% Phase 2: Cluster identities
    Client->>ClusterAPI: ENTRY: POST /recognition/clustering/jobs
    ClusterAPI->>ClusterSvc: cluster_unclustered_identities(tenant_id)
    ClusterSvc->>DB: SELECT unclustered identities
    ClusterSvc->>Discovery: rep/centroid/graph discovery
    Discovery-->>ClusterSvc: assignment candidates + new cluster proposals
    ClusterSvc->>Gate: evaluate(candidate)
    Gate-->>ClusterSvc: ACCEPT (happy path)
    ClusterSvc->>Writer: persist assignment / create cluster
    Writer->>DB: INSERT clusters + members + representatives
    ClusterSvc-->>ClusterAPI: {status: complete}
    ClusterAPI-->>Client: {status: complete}

    Note over API,Writer: Code anchors: routers/analyze.py, tasks/scan.py, scan_worker.py, cluster_service.py, orchestrator.py
